hat too big) plays three notes on a harmonica, over and over.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "And old CLEOPHAS \"CLEO\" JAMES (70s, one eye clouded) rocks in a battered chair.", "para": 2, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "The harmonica stops.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Tobias studies the horizon.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Delfina ties off a knot.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Hank halves the apple and hands a piece to Tobias without a word.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Tobias takes it.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Amos taps out his pipe against the rail.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Cleo lifts his chin.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Sniffs the air.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Rain?", "name": "AMOS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Maybe.", "name": "CLEO", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Neither says anything else.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "The first star shows in the east.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}]}